  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Klara Cosmetics is an Australian glam-beauty brand made for girls who want that flawless, expensive-looking finish without the drama. High pigment, high payoff, high confidence.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We create makeup that looks like luxury IRL and on camera. No basic formulas, no “almost” results. If it doesn’t serve main-character energy, we don’t launch it.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Share your link/code and get paid for every sale. No fees, no minimum followers, no gatekeeping. Top sellers get bonuses, free products, and VIP creator perks.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>GRWM, tutorials, unboxings, first reactions, before/after glow-ups, trend sounds, and aesthetic content. Be yourself, show your vibe, and make it feel real.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>This is <strong>early-access creator status</strong> — meaning bigger perks for those who join now before we close spots. We’re building a glam creator squad, not just a list.</p></div>",
